  "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli",project,Canonical behavior and contract reference; source is read-only for this programme
body: "Compatibility is proven through language-neutral fixtures and black-box differential tests. Runtime use of Node.js, Bun, JavaScript, TypeScript, or shelling out to pm is forbidden."
